      "name": "Expert Subsistence",
      "category": "interaction",
      "text": "While using Survival to subsist statistic=survival, if the forager rolls any result worse than a success, they get a success. On a success, they can provide subsistence living for themselves and four additional creatures, and on a critical success, they can take care of twice as many creatures as on a success.",
